OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn unsettled and cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain or showers,
OL,7,Fsome of these likely heavy at times.
OL,8,FBecoming windy, with a risk of gales
OL,9,Fnear the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA short-lived dry spell
OL,12,Fdeveloping into the evening before
OL,13,Ffurther cloud and heavy rain or
OL,14,Fshowers move eastwards across the
OL,15,Fregion from around midnight. Breezy,
OL,16,Fespecially along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
