OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA few showers possible
OL,6,Finitially, but soon becoming largely
OL,7,Fdry with sunny spells. Cloud building
OL,8,Flater with rain arriving into the
OL,9,Fevening. Winds mostly light, but
OL,10,Fstrengthening later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FUnsettled
OL,13,Fduring this period with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain throughout.
OL,15,FOften windy or very windy at times,
OL,16,Fwith a risk of gales. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
